exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand admin/new-booking-notification: admin/new-booking-notification text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

New booking


NEW BOOKING RECEIVED

TRIP  TR-01

Hi Admin,

A new booking has been received and payment confirmed. Here are the details:

Trip

09:30
12 August 2026
 
Pickup
DXB Terminal 3
 
 
Drop-off
Burj Al Arab

Trip #TR-01

----------------------------------------

Customer NameSarah Khan

Customer Emailsarah@example.com

Customer Phone

----------------------------------------

Vehicle CategoryBusiness

Vehicle TypeSedan

Total AmountAED 450.00

View Booking Details https://infiniatransfers.com/admin/bookings/1

This is an automated notification. Please review and assign a vendor to this booking.

Best regards,
Infinia Transfers System

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

