exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand admin/new-user-notification: admin/new-user-notification text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

New user


NEW USER REGISTERED

Hi Admin,

A new user has registered on the Infinia Transfers platform. Here are the details:

NameSarah Khan

Emailsarah@example.com

Phone+971500000000

Registration Date10 August 2026

Note: The user needs to verify their email address before they can access the platform.

View User Details https://infiniatransfers.com/admin/users/1

This is an automated notification. No action is required unless you need to review the user account.

Best regards,
Infinia Transfers System

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

