exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand auth/verification: auth/verification text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Verify your email


VERIFY YOUR EMAIL ADDRESS

Hi Sarah Khan,

Verify your email address to finish setting up your account and keep it secure.

Please click the button below to verify your email address:

Verify Email Address https://infiniatransfers.com/verify?token=abc

Or copy and paste this link into your browser:

https://infiniatransfers.com/verify?token=abc

This verification link will expire in 24 hours.

If you didn't request this verification, please ignore this email or contact our support team if you have concerns.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

