th="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tbody><tr><td style="color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;padding:8px 12px 8px 0">Base Fare (3 Passengers)</td><td align="right" style="color:#1a1917;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;padding:8px 0;white-space:nowrap">AED 400.00</td></tr><tr><td style="color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;padding:8px 12px 8px 0">Child seat (age 4)</td><td align="right" style="color:#1a1917;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;padding:8px 0;white-space:nowrap">AED 30.00</td></tr><tr><td style="color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;padding:8px 12px 8px 0">Meet and greet</td><td align="right" style="color:#1a1917;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;padding:8px 0;white-space:nowrap">AED 20.00</td></tr><tr><td style="border-top:1.5px solid #1a1917;color:#1a1917;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;padding:14px 12px 2px 0">Total Amount</td><td align="right" style="border-top:1.5px solid #1a1917;color:#1a1917;font-family:&#x27;Playfair Display&#x27;, Georgia, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;padding:12px 0 2px;white-space:nowrap">AED 450.00</td></tr></tbody></table><div style="color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:19px;margin-top:10px">Payment charged in USD 122.00</div><a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/invoice/1" class="em-btn" style="line-height:20px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;border-radius:8px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-align:center;margin:16px 10px 16px 0;background-color:#1a1917;border:1px solid #1a1917;color:#f4ece0;padding:15px 26px;padding-top:15px;padding-right:26px;padding-bottom:15px;padding-left:26px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:433.3333333333333%;mso-text-raise:22.5" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:11.25px">Download Invoice (PDF)</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:433.3333333333333%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:8px 0 16px;margin-top:8px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Keep this invoice for your records.</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:24px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">We&#x27;ll send you updates about your booking, including vendor assignment and any changes to your reservation.</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">To change this booking or ask a question, contact support with your trip number.</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Thanks for booking with Infinia Transfers.<br/><br/>Best regards,<br/>The Infinia Transfers Team</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="em-px" style="padding:28px 44px 8px;text-align:center"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:2px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:2px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:2px;margin-left:0">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Infinia Transfers<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:2px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:2px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:2px;margin-left:0">123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:2px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:2px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:2px;margin-left:0">This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:14px 0 0;text-align:center;margin-top:14px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0"><a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy" style="color:#6b5530;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a>  ·  <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/terms" style="color:#6b5530;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Terms of Service</a>  ·  <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/contact" style="color:#6b5530;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Contact Support</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
`;

exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand booking/confirmation: booking/confirmation text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Booking confirmed


BOOKING CONFIRMATION

TRIP  TR-01

Hi Sarah Khan,

Your booking is confirmed. Here are the details:

Your journey

09:30
12 August 2026
 
Pickup
DXB Terminal 3
 
 
Drop-off
Burj Al Arab

Trip #TR-01

Vehicle CategoryBusiness

Vehicle TypeSedan

Up to 3 passengers · Up to 2 luggage

Passengers2 adults, 1 child

----------------------------------------

Special RequestsPlease call on arrival.

Booking Summary

Base Fare (3 Passengers)AED 400.00Child seat (age 4)AED 30.00Meet and greetAED 20.00Total AmountAED 450.00

Payment charged in USD 122.00
Download Invoice (PDF) https://infiniatransfers.com/invoice/1

Keep this invoice for your records.

We'll send you updates about your booking, including vendor assignment and any changes to your reservation.

To change this booking or ask a question, contact support with your trip number.

Thanks for booking with Infinia Transfers.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

