exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand booking/driver-assigned: booking/driver-assigned text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Driver assigned


YOUR DRIVER HAS BEEN ASSIGNED

TRIP  TR-01

Hi Sarah Khan,

A driver has been assigned to your booking #TR-01.

Your Driver

OA
Omar Aziz
+971500000001 tel:+971500000001

Pickup Details

Trip #TR-01

Pickup Date12 August 2026

Pickup Time09:30

View Your Booking https://infiniatransfers.com/account

----------------------------------------

You can contact your driver directly on the number above closer to your pickup time.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

