eight:500;letter-spacing:0.04em">TR-01</span></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="em-px" style="padding:24px 44px 40px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Hi <!-- -->Sarah Khan<!-- -->,</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Your booking status has been updated. Here are the details:</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #ebe6df;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 20px;margin:20px 0"><tbody><tr><td><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tbody><tr><td class="em-label" valign="top" style="color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:21px;padding:7px 16px 7px 0;width:38%">Trip #</td><td class="em-value" valign="top" style="color:#1a1917;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;padding:7px 0">TR-01</td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tbody><tr><td class="em-label" valign="top" style="color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:21px;padding:7