/p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:2px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:2px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:2px;margin-left:0">This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:14px 0 0;text-align:center;margin-top:14px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0"><a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy" style="color:#6b5530;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a>  ·  <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/terms" style="color:#6b5530;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Terms of Service</a>  ·  <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/contact" style="color:#6b5530;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Contact Support</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
`;

exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand booking/status-update: booking/status-update text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Status update


BOOKING STATUS UPDATE

TRIP  TR-01

Hi Sarah Khan,

Your booking status has been updated. Here are the details:

Trip #TR-01

Vehicle CategoryBusiness

Pickup Date12 August 2026

Status Changedpending → confirmed

Additional Information:

Your driver has been arranged.

Contact support with your trip number if you have questions about this update.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

