exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand contact/admin-notification: contact/admin-notification text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

New enquiry


NEW CONTACT FORM SUBMISSION

Hi Admin,

A new contact form submission has been received. Here are the details:

NameSarah Khan

Emailsarah@example.com

Phone+971500000000

SubjectQuestion about airport pickup

Message

Do you cover Al Maktoum?

View in Admin Panel https://infiniatransfers.com/admin/contact/1

This is an automated notification. Please respond to the customer promptly.

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

