exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand contact/reply-notification: contact/reply-notification text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Our reply


RESPONSE TO YOUR INQUIRY

Dear Sarah Khan,

Thank you for contacting Infinia Transfers. Here is our response to your inquiry:

Yes, we cover Al Maktoum.

Reply to this email or contact us directly if you have more questions.

Best regards,
Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

