exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand direct-booking/customer-cancelled: direct-booking/customer-cancelled text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Booking cancelled


BOOKING CANCELLED

BOOKING  DB-2026-0001

Hi Sarah Khan,

This booking has been cancelled

Dunes Fleet has cancelled the booking below. No vehicle or driver is held for you any longer.

Booking ReferenceDB-2026-0001

VehicleToyota Previa

Original Pickup12 August 2026 at 09:30

----------------------------------------

If this is unexpected, or you would like to rebook, contact Dunes Fleet on +971500000002 and quote your booking reference. Any refund due is handled directly by Dunes Fleet.

Best regards,
Dunes Fleet

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

