exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand direct-booking/customer-status-update: direct-booking/customer-status-update text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Status update


BOOKING STATUS UPDATE

BOOKING  DB-2026-0001

Hi Sarah Khan,

Dunes Fleet has updated the status of your booking.

Booking ReferenceDB-2026-0001

VehicleToyota Previa

Pickup12 August 2026 at 09:30

Status ChangedPending → Confirmed

----------------------------------------

Questions? Contact Dunes Fleet on +971500000002 and quote your booking reference.

Best regards,
Dunes Fleet

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

