exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand driver/booking-assigned: driver/booking-assigned text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Trip assigned


TRIP ASSIGNED TO YOU

TRIP  TR-01

Hi Omar Aziz,

You have been assigned to trip #TR-01 by Dunes Fleet.

Trip Details

09:30
12 August 2026
 
Pickup
DXB Terminal 3
 
 
Drop-off
Burj Al Arab

Trip #TR-01

CustomerSarah Khan

Vehicle CategoryBusiness

Vehicle TypeSedan

Action Required

Please ensure you are available for the scheduled pickup time. Contact your dispatch manager if you have any questions or conflicts.

----------------------------------------

If you have any questions about this trip, please contact your vendor directly.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

