:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:4px 0">Track your earnings and analytics</li><li style="color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:4px 0">Update your availability and service areas</li><li style="color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:4px 0">Manage your profile and company information</li></ul><a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/vendor" class="em-btn" style="line-height:20px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;border-radius:8px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-align:center;margin:16px 10px 16px 0;background-color:#1a1917;border:1px solid #1a1917;color:#f4ece0;padding:15px 26px;padding-top:15px;padding-right:26px;padding-bottom:15px;padding-left:26px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:433.3333333333333%;mso-text-raise:22.5" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:11.25px">Access Your Vendor Dashboard</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:433.3333333333333%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Or log in at:<!-- --> <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/login" style="color:#6b5530;text-decoration:underline">https://infiniatransfers.com/login</a></p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="border-radius:10px;padding:16px 20px;margin:20px 0;background-color:#f6f1ec;border:1px solid #ece2d7"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 4px;color:#6b5530;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">Next Steps:</p><ol style="margin:0 0 16px 0;padding-left:22px"><li style="color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:4px 0">Complete your vendor profile</li><li style="color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:4px 0">Add your vehicles to the platform</li><li style="color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:4px 0">Set your availability and pricing</li><li style="color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:25px;margin:4px 0">Start receiving booking requests!</li></ol></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Vendor support can help you get started. Contact them any time.</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Welcome aboard.<br/><br/>Best regards,<br/>The Infinia Transfers Team</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="em-px" style="padding:28px 44px 8px;text-align:center"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:2px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:2px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:2px;margin-left:0">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Infinia Transfers<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:2px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:2px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:2px;margin-left:0">123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:2px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:2px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:2px;margin-left:0">This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:14px 0 0;text-align:center;margin-top:14px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0"><a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy" style="color:#6b5530;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a>  ·  <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/terms" style="color:#6b5530;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Terms of Service</a>  ·  <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/contact" style="color:#6b5530;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Contact Support</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
`;

exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand vendor/application-approved: vendor/application-approved text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Application approved


WELCOME TO INFINIA TRANSFERS!

Hi Dunes Fleet,

Your vendor application has been approved.

Your application (Reference: VA-9) is approved. You're now part of our vendor network.

Getting Started

You can now access your vendor dashboard to:

 * Add and manage your vehicle fleet
 * View and respond to booking requests
 * Track your earnings and analytics
 * Update your availability and service areas
 * Manage your profile and company information

Access Your Vendor Dashboard https://infiniatransfers.com/vendor

Or log in at: https://infiniatransfers.com/login

Next Steps:

 1. Complete your vendor profile
 2. Add your vehicles to the platform
 3. Set your availability and pricing
 4. Start receiving booking requests!

Vendor support can help you get started. Contact them any time.

Welcome aboard.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

