oboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">We&#x27;ve completed our review of your application (Reference: <!-- -->VA-9<!-- -->).</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="border-radius:10px;padding:16px 20px;margin:20px 0;background-color:#fbeceb;border:1px solid #f2d0cc"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0;color:#7a3a32;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">We can&#x27;t approve your vendor application.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:11px;line-height:16px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.14em;margin:28px 0 10px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:28px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin-left:0">Reason for decision</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="border-radius:10px;padding:16px 20px;margin:20px 0;background-color:#f9f7f4;border:1px solid #ebe6df"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0;color:#1a1917;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">Insurance documents expired.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">This is usually about service area coverage, fleet requirements or vendor capacity in your region rather than the quality of your service.</p><p style="font-s