tailed feedback, please don&#x27;t hesitate to contact our vendor support team. We&#x27;re here to help and provide guidance.</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Thanks for your interest in working with us.</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#5c5955;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Best regards,<br/>The Infinia Transfers Team</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="em-px" style="padding:28px 44px 8px;text-align:center"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:2px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:2px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:2px;margin-left:0">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Infinia Transfers<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:2px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:2px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:2px;margin-left:0">123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:2px 0;text-align:center;margin-top:2px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:2px;margin-left:0">This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#77726b;font-family:Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:14px 0 0;text-align:center;margin-top:14px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0"><a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy" style="color:#6b5530;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a>  ·  <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/terms" style="color:#6b5530;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Terms of Service</a>  ·  <a href="https://infiniatransfers.com/contact" style="color:#6b5530;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Contact Support</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
`;

exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand vendor/application-rejected: vendor/application-rejected text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Application update


APPLICATION STATUS UPDATE

Hi Dunes Fleet,

We've completed our review of your application (Reference: VA-9).

We can't approve your vendor application.

Reason for decision

Insurance documents expired.

This is usually about service area coverage, fleet requirements or vendor capacity in your region rather than the quality of your service.

Can you resubmit?

Yes, and there is no waiting period. Update your application to address the feedback above and send it back to us. You keep the same reference.

Update and Resubmit https://infiniatransfers.com/vendor-application/edit

If you have questions about this decision or would like more detailed feedback, please don't hesitate to contact our vendor support team. We're here to help and provide guidance.

Thanks for your interest in working with us.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

