exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand vendor/booking-datetime-modified: vendor/booking-datetime-modified text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Time changed


BOOKING TIME UPDATED

TRIP  TR-01

Hi Dunes Fleet,

The pickup time for booking #TR-01 has been changed by the business.

Time Change Details

Previous Time12 August 2026 at 09:30

New Time12 August 2026 at 11:00

Booking Details

Trip #TR-01

CustomerSarah Khan

Pickup LocationDXB Terminal 3

Reason for Change

Flight delayed

View Booking Details https://infiniatransfers.com/vendor/bookings/1

Action Required

Please update your schedule accordingly and ensure the assigned driver is informed of the new pickup time.

----------------------------------------

If you have any questions or concerns about this change, please contact the business directly or reach out to our support team.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

