TRANSFERS

 

Booking reassigned


BOOKING REASSIGNED

TRIP  TR-01

Hi Dunes Fleet,

Booking #TR-01 has been reassigned to another vendor.

Job

09:30
12 August 2026
 
Pickup
DXB Terminal 3

Booking Details

Trip #TR-01

CustomerSarah Khan

ReasonVendor unavailable

You no longer need to take any action on this booking. If you had assigned a driver or vehicle, their schedules have been automatically freed up.

View My Bookings https://infiniatransfers.com/vendor/bookings/1

----------------------------------------

If you have any questions, please contact our support team.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

