exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand wallet/low-balance-alert: wallet/low-balance-alert text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Wallet alert


LOW BALANCE ALERT

Hi Acme Hotel Group,

Your wallet balance is running low.
Current balance: AED 250.00
Alert threshold: AED 500.00

To avoid service interruptions, please add funds to your wallet as soon as possible.

Current Balance
AED 250.00

Alert ThresholdAED 500.00

Recommended ActionAdd funds to wallet

Add funds from your wallet dashboard. Keeping the balance above your threshold avoids interrupted service.

View Wallet Dashboard → https://infiniatransfers.com/business/wallet

If you have any questions or need assistance, please contact our support team.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

