exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand wallet/monthly-statement: wallet/monthly-statement text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Monthly statement


MONTHLY WALLET STATEMENT

Hi Acme Hotel Group,

Here's your wallet statement for July 2026.

Statement PeriodJuly 2026

Opening BalanceAED 1,000.00

Total Credits+AED 500.00

Total Debits-AED 750.00

Net Change-AED 250.00

----------------------------------------

Closing BalanceAED 750.00

Total Transactions12

Summary

 * You started the month with AED 1,000.00
 * You added AED 500.00 in credits
 * You spent AED 750.00 in debits
 * You ended the month with AED 750.00
 * You had 12 transactions

Download Full Statement

Download PDF Statement → https://infiniatransfers.com/statement.pdf

Your detailed statement PDF includes all transactions, descriptions, and reference numbers for the period.

View Wallet Dashboard → https://infiniatransfers.com/business/wallet

You can view your complete transaction history, download past statements, and manage your wallet settings from your dashboard.

If you have any questions about your statement or notice any discrepancies, please contact our support team.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand wallet/spending-limit-reached: wallet/spending-limit-reached html 1`] = `
"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"><html dir="ltr" lang="en"><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"/><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light"/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@500&amp;family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/><style>
@media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {
  .em-px { padding-left: 22px !important; padding-right: 22px !important; }
  .em-h1 { font-size: 25px !important; line-height: 32px !important; }
  .em-stack { display: block !important; width: 100% !important; }
  .em-stack-gap { padding: 10px 0 0 0 !important; }
  .em-hide { display: none !important; }
  .em-tcol { width: 64px !important; }
  .em-label { width: 100% !important; display: block !important; padding-bottom: 0 !important; }
