exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand wallet/spending-limit-reached: wallet/spending-limit-reached text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Spending limit


SPENDING LIMIT REACHED

Hi Acme Hotel Group,

Your daily spending limit has been reached!
A transaction of AED 450.00 was declined.

A transaction was declined because it would exceed your daily spending limit.

Limit TypeDaily Limit

Limit AmountAED 5,000.00

Current SpendAED 5,000.00

Rejected TransactionAED 450.00

Limit Resets11 August 2026

What you can do

 * Wait until 11 August 2026 when your daily limit resets
 * Contact support to request a temporary limit increase
 * Review and adjust your spending limit settings

View Wallet Dashboard → https://infiniatransfers.com/business/wallet | Contact Support → https://infiniatransfers.com/support

Spending limits are in place to help you manage your budget and prevent unexpected charges. If you need assistance or would like to adjust your limits, please contact our support team.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

