exports[`shared email templates render identically under the platform brand wallet/transaction-completed: wallet/transaction-completed text 1`] = `
"INFINIA

TRANSFERS

 

Transaction completed


TRANSACTION COMPLETED

Hi Acme Hotel Group,

A transaction has been credited to your wallet.

Amount
+AED 500.00

Transaction TypeCredit

DescriptionWallet top up

Previous BalanceAED 250.00

New BalanceAED 750.00

Transaction Date10 August 2026

Transaction IDTXN-0001

View Transaction History → https://infiniatransfers.com/business/wallet

If you have any questions about this transaction, please contact our support team with the transaction ID above.

Best regards,
The Infinia Transfers Team

© 2026 Infinia Transfers. All rights reserved.

123 Business Bay, Dubai, UAE

This email was sent to you as part of your account activity.

Privacy Policy https://infiniatransfers.com/privacy · Terms of Service https://infiniatransfers.com/terms · Contact Support https://infiniatransfers.com/contact"
`;

